+"""Bounded automatic approval (v0.2.21): policy file, contract with the real signer and verifier, duplicates, limits, retroactivity, spoofing,
+crash recovery, races. The automatic part may only publish an APPROVAL_SIG.json and a READY.md; the unchanged watcher decides and dispatches.
+Synthetic data, a throw-away key, a fake GitHub. No model, no operating state."""
+from __future__ import annotations
